{
  "note": "Illustrative model of one hypothetical residential block. kind=assumption means a labelled assumption chosen by the author (not calibrated to any project) and swept over [low, high]; kind=cited means the bound comes from data/bca_figures.json. Factory (off-site) labour is outside the model.",
